# infra/modules/lambda — terraform.tfvars.example
# This module is called from envs/poc/main.tf, not invoked standalone.
# Copy this file to terraform.tfvars and fill in real values if testing the module in isolation.
#
# IMPORTANT: Run `make lambda-deps` (or `cd infra/envs/poc/lambdas/authorizer && npm ci --omit=dev`) BEFORE
# running `terraform plan` — archive_file reads node_modules at plan time.

